  ------------------------------------------------------------
    the programme
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      0:00  I · OPENING (1. e4 c5)
            Warm alabaster and slate courtyard; the e-pawn
            hops two squares, Black answers c5, and the
            White Knight vaults the rank.

      0:20  II · THE GAMBIT
            Cerulean twilight; squares heave into a 3D
            canyon, Bishops fire diagonal beams, and a
            captured piece slices into spinning gold discs.

      0:44  III · ZEITNOT
            Crimson time trouble; a giant beveled brass
            escapement wheel and pendulum swing behind the
            besieged White King as the clock ticks in 16ths.

      1:08  IV · THE EIGHTH RANK
            Starry cobalt night; a lone White Pawn climbs
            an ascending stairway, spins inside two golden
            coronation rings, and crowns itself Queen.

      1:28  V · ZUGZWANG
            Daylight amphitheatre; the new Gold Queen and
            Knight deliver the royal fork, and the towering
            Black King tilts off its base in slow motion.

      1:52  VI · CHECKMATE
            Dawn silver-slate mirror board; the fallen
            Black King lies on its side before the standing
            White Queen and King.

  ------------------------------------------------------------
    how to run
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      Double-click intro.html in Edge or Chrome on Windows
      10 or 11, wait for the golden bar, then click. No
      server, no flags. ESC leaves fullscreen. A discrete
      GPU is recommended. Tested on an RTX 5090.

